ertain balls of chemicals into the air. The balls explode, carry out 'cloud seeding', bringing forth various effects like showers of acid or hail. Now replaced by NWO Chemtrails and weather satellites.<br /> <br /> The New Soviet Man. <br /> <br /> The new exemplar is shown to the Workers, with great stories extolling his Virtue and his hard work. The proletariat hears this, and works ever harder. This enhances the work efforts and results of a mine, a factory, or a farm; any place of production can be enhanced. This is now hilariously vulgar, but in the Soviet sphere of influence, less so.</div> </div> </div> </div>They killed doggos the technocracyis pure evil.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-27T20:20:16-07:00","id":1415775,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1415754-outdated-or-defunct-technocratic-procedure-devices?p=1415763#post1415763\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They killed doggos the technocracyis pure evil.</div> </div> </div> </div>Those were psychic doggos, newbie! For the sake of reality, they had to be destroyed!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-28T06:42:54-07:00","id":1415816,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1415754-outdated-or-defunct-technocratic-procedure-devices#post1415754\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The New Soviet Man.<br /> <br /> The new exemplar is shown to the Workers, with great stories extolling his Virtue and his hard work. The proletariat hears this, and works ever harder. This enhances the work efforts and results of a mine, a factory, or a farm; any place of production can be enhanced. This is now hilariously vulgar, but in the Soviet sphere of influence, less so.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wasn't there a memo explaining that this had been replaced with the <i>Employee of the Month</i> procedure, not as effective, but can get similar results.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26145-babi_gog","name":"babi_gog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26145_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"94"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-01T15:53:03-07:00","id":1416369,"title":"","content":"RADIOACTIVE BOOSTS (Life 3, now vulgar)<br /> <br /> The craze of radiation is upon us! Use the powers of radiation to enhance yourselves, transforming yourself into a greater being! Use it to gain powers, mix your genes with EDE genetics to gain superpowers, and more! This procedure uses radiation to induce mutations that are beneficial to the person, with a good enough roll allowing you to gain things like laser eyes, enhanced regeneration, and claws. Right now this will give you either cancer, or the mutations will be a mix of beneficial and drawbacks. At worst it just kills you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12952,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","user":"Accelerator","date":". 10-01-2020, 07:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-01T15:55:10-07:00","id":1416370,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1415754-outdated-or-defunct-technocratic-procedure-devices#post1415754\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The War Dogs<br /> <br /> A construct of the chirugeona. Dogs bred to be smarter, faster, and more sensitive. Specialized procedures were created so these k9 units could assist in the battlefield, with added implants and a regimen of drugs for added strength, durability, and sensitivity. Dogs were used to track down prey, or detect the scent of a vampire, Werewolf, or ghosts. High level beasts get things like clairvoyance and telekinesis. However due to budget cuts and a shifting paradigm more focused on machinery and human beings meant that these loyal dogs were put down. Recently there's been a talk on bringing them back, due to material loss by the Dimensional anomaly.</div> </div> </div> </div>I question whether it would be necessary to put the dogs down. More likely, they would simply not be allowed to breed, and any internal weapons being removed. Perhaps specimens kept by individual Technocrats of sufficient standing, for personal reasons.<br /> <br /> Less extravagant modifications could still have uses. Dogs that sniff out illnesses or become alert when supernatural creatures are near. I'm picturing a Progenitor with a genetically modified and trained animal companion (read: Familiar), that is used for various rotes.<br /> <br /> It may seem redundant, when machine solutions could be employed to do the same things. But critically, machines have a habit of not working correctly while in Reality Zones hostile to technology. Machines are also vulnerable to hacking or tampering by Traditionalist technomancers. By contrast, a Virtual Adept may not think to employ any countermeasures against a dog, even if they have the right skillset (read: Spheres) to do so. Because the Union's enemies/rivals expect Technocrats to only use machines, a dog acting as a line of defense can catch them off guard. A small advantage, but one that could make all the difference.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The New Soviet Man.<br /> <br /> The new exemplar is shown to the Workers, with great stories extolling his Virtue and his hard work. The proletariat hears this, and works ever harder. This enhances the work efforts and results of a mine, a factory, or a farm; any place of production can be enhanced. This is now hilariously vulgar, but in the Soviet sphere of influence, less so. </div> </div> </div>I would imagine this sort of project would get phased out, as NWO scientists realized they could get the same effects on workers with nothing but propaganda posters depicting the New Soviet Man. Far less Vulgar, too, since the workers tend to accept that unrealistic elements are artistic license, when they consider it at all. (Then again, as American media, fashion, and advertising prove, people can be made to accept widely distorted standards of what is aesthetically pleasing or effective).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-01T16:07:16-07:00","id":1416373,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bluecho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1415754-outdated-or-defunct-technocratic-procedure-devices?p=1416370#post1416370\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I question whether it would be necessary to put the dogs down. More likely, they would simply not be allowed to breed, and any internal weapons being removed. Perhaps specimens kept by individual Technocrats of sufficient standing, for personal reasons.<br /> <br /> Less extravagant modifications could still have uses. Dogs that sniff out illnesses or become alert when supernatural creatures are near. I'm picturing a Progenitor with a genetically modified and trained animal companion (read: Familiar), that is used for various rotes.<br /> <br /> It may seem redundant, when machine solutions could be employed to do the same things. But critically, machines have a habit of not working correctly while in Reality Zones hostile to technology. Machines are also vulnerable to hacking or tampering by Traditionalist technomancers. By contrast, a Virtual Adept may not think to employ any countermeasures against a dog, even if they have the right skillset (read: Spheres) to do so. Because the Union's enemies/rivals expect Technocrats to only use machines, a dog acting as a line of defense can catch them off guard. A small advantage, but one that could make all the difference.</div> </div> </div> </div>I remember the technocrats having a liking for combat homunculi. Perahps a dog with shape-shifting abilities to turn into a combat form? <br /> <br /> But you're right. Let's change it. Those with psychic powers were put down as a host of reality deviancy. Those with enhanced senses that can be explained away marginally by modern science were probably put under a more... subdued capacity. Even if they were to be put back into combat, they wouldn't fight with psychic powers, they'll use hypervelocity quills or organic flamethrowers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-03T04:46:16-07:00","id":1416608,"title":"","content":"I mean, even the modern Technocracy has psychic personnel (i.e. Mages with a Psionic paradigm) at least as of the Revised era, so psychic dogs wouldn't necessarily be RDs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1410-czernobog","name":"Czernobog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-04T04:42:14-07:00","id":1416710,"title":"","content":"I guess any procedures based on \u201cdisproven\u201d science.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-30T23:24:15-07:00","id":1421124,"title":"","content":"Syndicate - Media Control: using newspapers to diffuse Mind effects.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","nam